<p><b>What&apos;s on My Raspberry Pi 5</b><br/><small>22.09.2024</small></p>
<p align="center"><img src="/wap/img/16f50bee8986397c81d36baf51c131b8c57c2018.wbmp" alt="Raspberry Pi 5 board held in a hand against a mountain view"/></p>
<p>A couple of months ago I bought a Raspberry Pi 5. Here&apos;s what came out of it.</p>
<p><b>About the goals</b></p>
<p>I didn&apos;t have a specific goal. The main idea was to stop using cloud VDS (I had 3 on <b>DigitalOcean</b>), thereby slightly reducing monthly costs.</p>
<p>Since I have a static IP, I decided to move some of my personal services onto it.</p>
<p>But the Raspberry Pi 5 even exceeded my expectations.</p>
<p>Now, let&apos;s go in order.</p>
